 "provenance_note": "Registry-native cohort: AACT search returned 1377 psoriasis drug records; 136 trials posted a PASI-75/90/100 result; 46 had a usable active-vs-control responder pair (per-arm N, single controlled timepoint). AACT-results-posted cohort, NOT a dual-screened systematic review; responder counts are derived events = round(PASI% * N) with fail-closed plausibility. Synthesis hierarchy: Bayesian PASI-90 league (psoriasis_league.json), IL-17/IL-23 > TNF (P=1.000)."
